Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:37.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is the year 0079\Nof the Universal Century.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.87,0:01:40.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The "second moon” known as Luna II
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.37,0:01:44.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}was an asteroid that was brought\Nto provide the mineral resources{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.96,0:01:46.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}needed to build the space colonies.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:50.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Next to it is the seventh city,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:54.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Side 7, whose construction began two years before {\i1}war broke out between,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.82,0:01:57.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the Principality of Zeon\Nand the Earth Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Four clusters of colonies\Nhave been destroyed in this war,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.75,0:02:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and now only a few of\Nthe Side 6 colonies remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.38,0:02:13.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The colony cluster called\Nthe Principality of Zeon is located...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:15.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the farthest away from Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:20.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Its supreme commander,\NGihren Zabi, cried out,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:23.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Strike the weakness of\Nthe Earth Federation!”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:28.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was as if he were the only one\Nwho could ever save humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.75,0:02:48.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Core Fighter, Amuro. Can you hear us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.61,0:02:50.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Gunperry has been launched.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.15,0:02:52.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger. I'll make contact
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.63,0:02:54.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll start counting once you initiate docking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:57.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We want to reduce the time\Nby 3 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:03:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger that. Mr. Ryu, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:01.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:05.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, standby for docking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.77,0:03:09.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:12.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu, synchronize docking searcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.47,0:03:17.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laser searcher synchronized.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:19.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,5.. 4.. 3..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.66,0:03:20.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,2... 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:22.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam B Parts released!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.41,0:03:27.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Core Change! Docking, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:47.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly 19 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:49.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too slow. Can you cut 4 more?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:51.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sounds impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.38,0:03:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's taking the laser searcher\Ntime to synchronize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:57.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright, a mayday signal\Nfrom the Federation air force.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.11,0:03:59.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation air force?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.07,0:04:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is it? The enemy's numbers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:05.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's an automated signal,\NSo we can't communicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:07.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:09.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Point 305.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.42,0:04:11.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Point 305, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:13.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:16.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll have Amuro check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.03,0:04:19.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, separate Core Fighter\Nfrom Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go check out Point 305\Nin the Core Fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:24.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:28.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu, I'm releasing the Gundam parts.\NWill you retrieve them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:30.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.\NThough, I don't like seeing it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.46,0:04:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:37.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright. Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:44.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.45,0:04:46.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate to see the Gundam like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:00.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Point 305... That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:13.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.70,0:05:32.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.92,0:05:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.\NTry to get information from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:43.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, tell me if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:47.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tsk, the Federation isn't even\Ncoming for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:49.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy\Nmay still be lurking somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Call for level 2 battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:52.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:03.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:08.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:16.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But why did they leave these pilots in the seats and just take their weapons without finishing them off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:19.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:27.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:07.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go away, you soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.24,0:07:08.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go on home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:13.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever! Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.91,0:07:16.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, leave this island, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.73,0:07:21.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:23.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:24.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.53,0:07:29.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's destroy that fighter plane too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:30.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:35.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Darn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.77,0:07:43.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Doan! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:45.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Doan!\N- Doan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.40,0:07:50.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I didn't think this island was occupied by Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:51.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.43,0:07:57.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey Doan, we've got another soldier\Non our island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:07:59.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He pointed a gun at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.27,0:08:06.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're not looking for a fight
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:09.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Surrender your weapons,\Nand we won't harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.70,0:08:12.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surrender my weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The ball is in your hands.\NWhy don't you just finish me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.02,0:08:19.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We don't want to fight,\Nso I'm asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:30.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kids, stay here where it's safe.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.26,0:08:34.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doan, just crush him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:35.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.37,0:08:38.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You think you can beat\Nthis Zaku with a plane like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.31,0:08:40.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I may not be able to finish it off,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I can immobilize it\Nwith a precision missile attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.01,0:08:50.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I can destroy the joints...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.18,0:08:54.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:58.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.24,0:09:32.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ow...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:11.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.51,0:10:12.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rollan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.90,0:10:15.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where on earth am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:17.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The home of Doan and the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.49,0:10:19.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:22.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cucuruz Doan.\NHe's the one who saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:24.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:27.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Doan will let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:30.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rest here until you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:32.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, where did you take\Nmy Core Fighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:38.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just like Doan said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:41.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doan's in the field with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:57.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:07.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.17,0:11:09.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems like you've recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.38,0:11:11.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.78,0:11:13.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your fighter plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.09,0:11:18.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must put the safety of these kids first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.28,0:11:22.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Zeon guys will find me here\Nsooner or later and attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:26.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the same for me.\NI need my weapons to protect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.46,0:11:27.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me back my Core Fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:31.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if I do that,\Nyou'll come after me, too. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:36.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not a coward like you,\Nwho tricks kids for your schemes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:38.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting the Zeon invaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.47,0:11:40.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't talk like that about Doan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.01,0:11:42.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doan's not tricking us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:45.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's protecting our island!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:47.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave, if that's what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:49.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we don't want you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.13,0:11:52.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've trained them well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:54.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you say!? You...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:55.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:58.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fighting brings nothing good.\NI always tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, this guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:02.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll find the Core Fighter,\None way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:43.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He couldn't have taken it that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.81,0:12:55.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doan, he won't find it, will he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:57.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he'll never find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.09,0:12:58.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah never.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:22.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're more stubborn than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:25.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spying on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.93,0:13:31.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't even see the beauty\Nin that sunset, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:37.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beauty is useless in war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:39.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a dangerous distraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:44.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doan isn't the man you think he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.05,0:13:47.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He seems to be good at\Ndeceiving children, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:51.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.19,0:13:52.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:58.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he's so great,\Nwhy would he hide my Core Fighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.11,0:14:01.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't know what those kids\Nhave been going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:08.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're not so naive\Nthat they'd blindly follow Doan here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:12.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, why does he take care of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:15.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ask him yourself,\Nif you want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:21.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doan sees something in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.74,0:14:23.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He says that\Nif you grow up a bit more,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:25.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then you'll be a great soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:39.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't see anyone down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:42.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ryu, we're ending\Nour search mission for today.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:43.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't he see\Nthat we're really worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:52.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He should contact us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Amuro we're talking about.\NI'm sure he has his reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:14:58.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.21,0:14:59.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope he's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.94,0:15:01.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.18,0:15:28.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,-A-A Zaku's here!\N-A-A Zaku's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.73,0:15:38.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, Zeon's nowhere to be seen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.44,0:15:43.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're still up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.65,0:15:47.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, about that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:49.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't just leave him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure his main force\Nis somewhere nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:56.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless he changes his mind,\Nhe'll be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:58.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've lived in fear for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:01.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to free myself soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:07.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:21.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.44,0:16:24.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get off this island, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.76,0:16:27.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:27.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.99,0:16:33.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you didn't get\Nmuch sleep either, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:37.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll resume the search!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:42.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An unidentified object, approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.94,0:16:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's coming fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:45.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it coming this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:48.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's heading towards Point 305.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:50.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's send Ryu there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.61,0:16:52.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. The White Base will go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:53.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:01.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:03.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get off this island, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.09,0:17:03.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.97,0:17:12.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a Zaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.54,0:17:20.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:28.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.67,0:17:31.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are the kids!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:32.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.31,0:17:39.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doan I need my Core Fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:41.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:49.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The house...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.42,0:17:50.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.09,0:17:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:04.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Zaku... What's it after?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.66,0:18:17.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro, you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:20.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.85,0:18:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I explain later,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.71,0:18:26.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One of the Zakus is on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:30.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.93,0:18:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.89,0:18:38.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.76,0:18:41.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes! Please launch the Gundam at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:42.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll dock in mid-air.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:45.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, land on the ship and then convert.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.19,0:18:47.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Omur, prepare for conversion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:50.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But my skills have improved...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:29.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's only one Zaku left
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:31.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hold it. I'll take on this one.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.11,0:19:33.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But you don't have enough weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.67,0:19:38.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll show you what a melee combat between\Nmobile suits looks like. Watch closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:41.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... Doan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:46.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:47.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.06,0:19:51.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as the kids are watching,\NI'll keep on fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:54.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Doan, beat up that Zaku!\N- Doan, beat up that Zaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.84,0:19:56.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you'll win!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:57.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.11,0:20:00.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't really get it either...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:04.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:14.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The one who killed\Nthe kids' parents is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.26,0:20:16.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.55,0:20:20.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were killed by\Na stray bullet I shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.76,0:20:25.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zeon told me to kill the kids, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:29.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't do it.\NSo I ran, taking the kids with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:33.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I protect these kids,\Neven it it costs me my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:34.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.57,0:20:42.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.97,0:20:45.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:54.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:57.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let you kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.78,0:21:20.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doan, you were awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.55,0:21:22.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're our hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:27.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those guys will come after me,\Nas long as I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:31.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I stay with them, the kids\Nwill continue to be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:33.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What am I to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:36.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's not because you're with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:43.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the stench of war on you\Nthat attracts the pursuers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.68,0:21:47.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stench of war?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.47,0:21:48.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,let me remove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cucuruz Doan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.08,0:22:11.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:12.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're hurting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.81,0:22:14.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.85,0:22:29.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doan...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.39,0:22:32.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- We'll get him.\N- We'll get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.10,0:22:33.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kids, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.96,0:22:35.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get angry at the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.06,0:22:37.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, oh why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:39.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look what he just did!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.69,0:22:43.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.49,0:22:48.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rollan, he's a nice boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.74,0:22:50.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.70,0:22:54.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.52,0:23:22.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gallop and Gouf appear in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.88,0:23:25.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla, wanting to know\NChar's whereabouts,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.05,0:23:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,takes off on her own,\Nviolating orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.59,0:23:31.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, her reckless maneuver\Nputs the Gundam in great danger...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.78,0:23:33.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will Amuro fight to save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.50,0:23:36.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.58,0:23:37.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla's Agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:40.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you be able to survive?
